From 7ad9def9692c861008ac7993665549aa13360ff6 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: terminills <tdeters@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 10 Aug 2026 20:31:29 -0500
Subject: [PATCH 550/638] AROS: scope Blink renderer state for hosted VS Code

Key process-owned Blink and Chromium renderer state by hosted AROS process identity or make shared-runtime reentry idempotent, covering the VS Code multiprocess bring-up chain through BrowserWindow, BrowserFrame, and DiskDataAllocator boundaries.

Keep service-worker Mojo connector telemetry for the active/ investigation and add a evidence breadcrumb documenting the remaining runtime proof required.

Verification: ninja -C out/aros-cef-bootstrap -j32 obj/cef/libcef.a
